---
import { LINKS } from '../config/links';
---
<aside class="post-cta">
  <div class="cta-card">
    <span class="cta-label">12 weeks · 1:1 with Joel</span>
    <h3>The <em>Money Story Method</em></h3>
    <p>If this sounded like you, this is how we fix it together. Twelve weeks, one to one, and we build your money system on the call.</p>
    <a href={LINKS.coaching + '#apply'} class="btn-primary">Book your free call</a>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
    <div class="cta-mini">
      <span class="cta-label">Free · weekly</span>
      <h4>Finance Fridays</h4>
      <p>One email a week on money and how we behave with it. Honest, and based on the research.</p>
      <a href={LINKS.newsletter} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join for free →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="credential-strip">
    Written by <em>Joel</em> · MSc Behavioural Economics · Qualified Financial Planner
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .post-cta {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 5rem auto 0;
    padding: 0 0 4rem;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
  }
  .cta-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-sc);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .cta-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cta-card h3 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--color-gold); font-weight: 400; }
  .cta-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.85);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  .cta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cta-mini {
    background: var(--color-bg-white);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .cta-mini .cta-label { color: var(--color-slate); }
  .cta-mini h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .cta-mini p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .cta-mini a {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .cta-mini a:hover { color: var(--color-gold-hover); }

  .credential-strip {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-warm);
    font-family: var(--font-heading-sc);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .credential-strip em { font-style: normal; color: var(--color-gold); }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .cta-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-card { padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
